    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>287208</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Mint&gt;……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Mint&gt;...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>287264</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>遅くなってすいません</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm sorry I took so long.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>287364</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なかなかふたりに
なれないから……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, we don't get much
time just to ourselves, so...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>287364</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>みんなにバレなかったかな……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I hope they didn't figure it out...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>287460</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ゴメンなさい、
たぶん、皆さん、
わかってらっしゃると思います</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm sorry, but... I think
everyone noticed...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>287600</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>え……！？　本当に……？
まいったな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eh...!? Really...?
That's not good...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>287600</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ま、いっか……僕たち、
別にやましいこと
してるわけじゃないし……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, well... It's not like
we're doing anything
to feel ashamed of.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>287668</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……やましいこと……
って……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...To feel ashamed
of...? Such as...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>287712</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>え……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eh...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>287808</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>で、でも……
ほんと、ふたりで話すのって
けっこう久しぶりだよね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>B-But, anyway... It's really been
a long time since we were last
able to talk, just the two of us.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>287940</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そう、ですね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yes, it has.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>287940</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>出会ってから、ずいぶん経った
のに、まだそんなに経って
いないような気さえします……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's been quite a long time since
we first met, and yet I feel as if
it hasn't been very long at all.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>288012</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうだね……
あれからいろいろあったね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah... A lot has happened
since we were in that dungeon.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>288056</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>はい……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yes...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>288160</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ダオスを倒した時、
考えたんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>When we defeated Dhaos,
I had a thought.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>288160</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ああ、これって
ハッピーエンドなんだって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>"This is our
happy ending."</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>288204</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私も……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I thought the same thing.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>288392</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも、違った。その後、みんなに
『英雄』って持ち上げられて、
その違和感に悩んだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But, I was wrong. Since then,
everyone has called us heroes,
and it's never sat right with me.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>288392</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それで思ったんだ、人生に
ハッピーはあっても、
ハッピーエンドはないんだって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So I started to think, that's what
life is like. Even if you find some
happiness, life still goes on.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>288476</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>人生は山あり谷あり、
続いていく、ということですね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yes. It continues, through
both good times and bad.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>288624</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うん、楽しいことがあれば、
悲しいこともある</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah. There are fun parts,
but also sad parts.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>288624</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もしかして……
&lt;Mint&gt;ともケンカする時が
あるかもしれない。それに……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Maybe I'll even...end
up fighting with you
someday. And then...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>288672</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それに……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And then...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>288732</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……いつか別れる時が来る</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...We'll end up apart.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>288776</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いやっ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>No...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>288928</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>考えたくないけど、
避けられないことだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We don't want to think about it, but
it's not something we can avoid.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>288928</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……でも、どんな辛い時でも、
僕たちにはそれを乗り越える
生きていく強い力がある</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...But, however painful that may
be, we have the strength to
overcome it and keep on living.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>288984</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>生きていく強い力……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The strength to keep living...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289072</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それを……どんな時も、
失っちゃいけないんだって……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's...the one thing
we can never lose...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289124</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Cless&gt;さん……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Cless&gt;...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289176</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>は、はい……！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Y-Yes...!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289264</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ク、&lt;Cless&gt;さんは
ちょっと真面目すぎると……
思います</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I think...sometimes,
you might be a little
too honest, &lt;Cless&gt;...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289332</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……そ、それを
君が言うの……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...A-Are you really
one to talk...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289540</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>とにかく……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Anyway...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289540</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>強くあって……あり続けて、
それでも……つらい時は……
いつでも私が……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You're strong...and you will
ever remain strong, but...still,
when you're hurting, I'll always...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289540</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……い、いえ、
みんなが、&lt;Cless&gt;さんの力に
なります！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...N-No, everyone...
All of us will be
there for you!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289540</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そのことを……
忘れないでください</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Please...don't
ever forget that.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289588</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……ありがとう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Thank you.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289644</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>い、いえ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>N-No, that's...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>39</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289644</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>39</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289692</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あ、あの……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>U-Um...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>41</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289740</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あ、えと……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Um, uhh...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289836</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あぁっ！！　もうじれったい！！
何やってんのよ、あんたたちは！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ahhh! Get to the good part already!
What are you two even doing!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>43</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289908</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>わっ！　&lt;Arche&gt;！
何やってるんだよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whoa! &lt;Arche&gt;!
What are you doing!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>44</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289976</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>バカ、&lt;Arche&gt;、
おまえ早すぎ……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You idiot, &lt;Arche&gt;,
you're too early...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>45</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>290028</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Chester&gt;さんまで……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Chester&gt;, too...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>46</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>290072</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>は～い∀</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hello~!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>47</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>290128</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>えっへへ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ehehe...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>48</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>290192</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Dio&gt;と&lt;Mel&gt;に&lt;Rody&gt;も……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Dio&gt; and &lt;Mel&gt; and even &lt;Rody&gt;...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>49</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>290256</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ぼくたちも
来ちゃいました……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We're here too...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>50</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>290336</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>オレはやめとけって
言ったんだぜ、でも&lt;Arche&gt;が</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I told &lt;Arche&gt; not to follow
you, but she wouldn't stop.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>51</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>290412</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも、&lt;Chester&gt;だって、
『早すぎ』って……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But, &lt;Chester&gt;, didn't you just
say Arche came out "too early"?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>52</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>290492</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうよぅ、あんたも、
ノリノリだったくせに！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, exactly! You wanted
to watch them, too!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>53</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>290568</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ああ、ふたりとも、
私のために争わないで！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh my! I'm honored, but
please don't fight over me!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>54</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>290656</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もう、また&lt;Rody&gt;さん、
ひっかきまわすんだから……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>C'mon, &lt;Rody&gt;, do you
always have to make it worse?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>55</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>290716</PointerOffset>
